WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.351 --> 00:00:18.180
It is a beautiful morning. Jot is at the playground.

2
00:00:19.710 --> 00:00:20.940
What a fun playground.

3
00:00:22.290 --> 00:00:23.460
Huh? What is that?

4
00:00:24.840 --> 00:00:25.411
A map.

5
00:00:27.901 --> 00:00:29.640
Everyone, look at the map.

6
00:00:31.050 --> 00:00:32.311
Can you point to it?

7
00:00:42.240 --> 00:00:43.080
Let's look together.

8
00:00:44.370 --> 00:00:47.130
A red circle. What can it be?

9
00:00:48.719 --> 00:00:52.020
Look around the playground. Can you see something red?

10
00:00:54.360 --> 00:00:56.460
I see it. The red slide.

11
00:00:58.620 --> 00:01:00.120
Point to the red slide.

12
00:01:10.530 --> 00:01:13.350
Now march with me. March, march, march.

13
00:01:22.560 --> 00:01:23.430
Woo-hoo.

14
00:01:25.321 --> 00:01:26.071
Is someone there?

15
00:01:28.500 --> 00:01:29.100
Hello.

16
00:01:30.870 --> 00:01:31.290
Hello.

17
00:01:32.670 --> 00:01:34.290
Hello, I'm Echo.

18
00:01:35.610 --> 00:01:37.141
Hello, I'm Jot.

19
00:01:38.370 --> 00:01:39.690
Nice to meet you, Jot.

20
00:01:40.830 --> 00:01:41.760
Nice to meet you, too.

21
00:01:43.141 --> 00:01:44.310
Wave hello to Echo.

22
00:01:51.510 --> 00:01:52.380
Hello, everyone.

23
00:01:54.601 --> 00:01:58.830
Look, I found a blue star sticker. Is it on your map?

24
00:02:00.180 --> 00:02:01.560
Yes, a new clue.

25
00:02:03.540 --> 00:02:04.200
Come with us.

26
00:02:05.160 --> 00:02:05.461
Look.

27
00:02:06.180 --> 00:02:06.930
Two swings.

28
00:02:07.980 --> 00:02:11.851
Can you find the blue swings? Look carefully.

29
00:02:13.470 --> 00:02:15.270
Point to the blue swings.

30
00:02:25.351 --> 00:02:26.160
There they are.

31
00:02:27.240 --> 00:02:28.110
Let's go.

32
00:02:30.270 --> 00:02:34.320
Hello. Hello there. I'm Boom.

33
00:02:35.220 --> 00:02:35.970
I'm Echo.

34
00:02:36.750 --> 00:02:38.820
And I'm Jot. Nice to meet you, Boom.

35
00:02:39.570 --> 00:02:42.360
Nice to meet you, too. Are you playing a game?

36
00:02:43.440 --> 00:02:45.030
Yes, it's a hello hunt.

37
00:02:45.900 --> 00:02:49.050
A hello hunt? Wow, that sounds fun.

38
00:02:50.760 --> 00:02:51.510
I found this.

39
00:02:52.440 --> 00:02:53.550
The next clue.

40
00:02:55.290 --> 00:02:56.610
A yellow square.

41
00:02:58.141 --> 00:03:01.530
Clap for the new clue. Clap, clap. Yay.

42
00:03:11.820 --> 00:03:15.209
Let's find it. I see something yellow.

43
00:03:16.890 --> 00:03:17.910
Is it the slide?

44
00:03:19.110 --> 00:03:19.531
No.

45
00:03:20.791 --> 00:03:21.781
Is it the swings?

46
00:03:23.160 --> 00:03:23.580
No.

47
00:03:25.020 --> 00:03:25.890
Can you find it?

48
00:03:27.510 --> 00:03:28.620
Stand up and look.

49
00:03:30.270 --> 00:03:32.220
Point to the yellow sandbox.

50
00:03:42.601 --> 00:03:44.070
Yes, the sandbox.

51
00:03:45.360 --> 00:03:46.500
Who's waiting there?

52
00:03:48.120 --> 00:03:49.980
Hello, friends. I'm Tail.

53
00:03:50.281 --> 00:03:52.351
Hello, I'm Boom.

54
00:03:53.610 --> 00:03:54.390
I'm Echo.

55
00:03:55.531 --> 00:03:56.281
And I'm Jot.

56
00:03:57.330 --> 00:03:58.500
Nice to meet you, Tail.

57
00:03:59.760 --> 00:04:02.490
Nice to meet you, too. I have the last clue.

58
00:04:03.660 --> 00:04:04.620
A rainbow circle.

59
00:04:05.820 --> 00:04:06.510
Where is it?

60
00:04:07.740 --> 00:04:11.281
Sit and look around the playground. Can you see a rainbow circle?

61
00:04:12.870 --> 00:04:18.421
There it is. This is the friendship circle, but it's sleeping.

62
00:04:19.860 --> 00:04:20.880
How do we wake it up?

63
00:04:21.960 --> 00:04:23.281
We need the magic pattern.

64
00:04:24.510 --> 00:04:25.800
Can you help our friends?

65
00:04:27.420 --> 00:04:29.160
First, jump one time.

66
00:04:36.180 --> 00:04:38.100
Now, stomp two times.

67
00:04:46.140 --> 00:04:47.520
Now give a thumbs up.

68
00:04:55.230 --> 00:04:58.201
The friendship circle's open. We did it.

69
00:04:59.550 --> 00:05:01.050
Look, something's happening.

70
00:05:03.451 --> 00:05:04.320
Four stars.

71
00:05:05.580 --> 00:05:06.540
One for Jot.

72
00:05:08.010 --> 00:05:09.091
One for Echo.

73
00:05:10.710 --> 00:05:11.580
One for Boom.

74
00:05:12.960 --> 00:05:14.010
And one for Tail.

75
00:05:15.360 --> 00:05:18.420
The hello hunt brought four new friends together.

76
00:05:19.560 --> 00:05:21.150
We found all the clues.

77
00:05:22.380 --> 00:05:24.000
We opened the friendship circle.

78
00:05:25.110 --> 00:05:26.250
And now we're friends.

79
00:05:27.360 --> 00:05:29.730
Wave hello to the four new friends.

80
00:05:37.410 --> 00:05:38.250
Hello, friends.

81
00:05:39.600 --> 00:05:43.260
Now clap for our new friendship. Hooray!

82
00:05:44.880 --> 00:05:48.091
The playground bell rings. It's time to go home.

83
00:05:49.290 --> 00:05:50.040
See you, Echo.

84
00:05:51.240 --> 00:05:52.140
See you, Jot.

85
00:05:53.250 --> 00:05:53.940
See you, Tail.

86
00:05:54.930 --> 00:05:55.591
See you, Boom.

87
00:05:56.281 --> 00:05:58.710
Wave to your friends and say, "See you."

88
00:06:09.210 --> 00:06:09.660
See you.

89
00:06:17.250 --> 00:06:18.330
What is this?

90
00:06:24.841 --> 00:06:26.189
It's a star.

91
00:06:29.189 --> 00:06:30.210
What is this?

92
00:06:36.420 --> 00:06:37.380
It's a square.

93
00:06:40.561 --> 00:06:41.460
What is this?

94
00:06:47.520 --> 00:06:48.510
It's a circle.

95
00:06:51.901 --> 00:06:52.831
Who is this?

96
00:06:59.190 --> 00:07:00.240
It's Tail.

97
00:07:03.390 --> 00:07:04.410
Who is this?

98
00:07:10.440 --> 00:07:11.430
It's Jot.

99
00:07:15.600 --> 00:07:18.000
Great job, boys and girls. Bye bye.
